LISA MP-probe-2fence
Scopes=(sys (gpu (cta 0) (cta 1)))
"D14(c)+(i): the LIVE two-fence probe. TWO system-scope fences per proc, MP shape, every access relaxed. Ordered only by the axiom-(2) fence clauses, which exist only because tag2events('release) contains fence events."
{
}
 P0                 | P1                  ;
 w[relaxed,sys] x 1 | r[relaxed,sys] r0 y ;
 f[release,sys]     | f[acquire,sys]      ;
 f[acquire,sys]     | f[release,sys]      ;
 w[relaxed,sys] y 1 | r[relaxed,sys] r1 x ;

scopes: (sys (gpu (cta 0) (cta 1)))
exists (1:r0=1 /\ 1:r1=0)
